Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在找人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思 我似乎弄错了房间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用这么急着走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们好难才能相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,水晶男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra 抓住它!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是否已经得到宇宙诞生的秘密\N创造出银河的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不~请再给我些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没时间了 工会非常急需这力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓紧时间伯爵 不允许有丝毫差错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也想得到创造出银河的力量吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙诞生的秘密吗 我才不稀罕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗 你的目的是海贼工会吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告诉我Cobra\N你过去和工会之间到底发生了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们夺取了我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夺取了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的梦想被他们夺取了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.27,0:01:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时间弹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它会令中弹者身边的时间流逝速度\N减慢至万分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经变成活雕像了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在此与他道别吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要去将这资料...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要这样 Cobra 你会死的!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此  看来他被称为\N拥有不死之身的男人并不是虚言啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,驱使你做垂死挣扎的是仇恨吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你非常仇恨工会 我可很清楚Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过去你曾深爱的三姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是那些女人们已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并且杀了她们的就是我们工会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手 那样是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨蛋 精神感应枪的力量取决于精神力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在连烧焦一张纸的力量都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去死吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别过去 前面是瀑布
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你...你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是Armaroid 莱迪 是Cobra的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来~上船吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说你已经杀死了Cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 现在他正葬身海底成了鱼的饵食了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你见到他的尸体吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先别管他了 他已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,话说回来你看这个 这是化石虫的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,创造宇宙的力量\N我已经找到了它的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也来开开眼界吧 男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra 还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是说他还活着吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说你们工会杀了他所深爱的三姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra他一定会为了复仇再次回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很了解他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我再告诉你一件事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀了那三个女人的...是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让开 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们在这里干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不是要和吉普森狗战斗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就得改良引擎才行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要令它可以变成可以在异次元移动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,交给我们 只要花费半天的时间\N我们就能将这引擎变得强劲无敌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们打算得到创造宇宙的力量\N如果真的让他们得到的话\N那么这个银河会变得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对不能让他们的阴谋得逞\N得去阻止他们才行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 Cobra说过不能让那个落入工会手中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心 并没有伤害到要害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,话说回来 快看看这个\N恢复力快得简直让人无法相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恢复力简直就像蜥蜴的尾巴一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去追那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经到达732和116的地点了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 已经到达目的地了 现在准备降落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始次元潜航
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,2,000米 仍旧在降落中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,火星的内部有巨大的空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那个!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里就是目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古代火星人的都市
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.31,0:10:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,曾经如神一般君领全宇宙\N又留下许多神秘之谜后就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传说中的古代火星人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是神 是曾经统治宇宙的万能之神
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古代火星人的足迹遍布全宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地球人这样叫他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,摩亚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里有他们就是神的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.23,0:11:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是银河
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里面的是尚未出世的星云
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几千亿个行星都在等待被释放的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 这是卵 它们可说是宇宙的卵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是创造宇宙的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古代火星人就是创造宇宙的神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然而现在我们工会终于得到了这力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,工会要这些星云来干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这只卵原本应该放在没有星星的空间中卵化
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但要是将它放在这个银河系中卵化呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 现在的银河系就会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能将烦人的银河警察在一瞬间消灭的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,工会一直在寻找着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:12:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,神的工作就是创造\N并且人类的任务就是破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了 成功了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进入异次元空间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电脑程序锁定 启动飞行编码
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,次元移动引擎输出功率上升到200%
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 引擎处于最佳状态
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Ok! 起飞吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雷达显示有不明物体正高速接近我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 快查清楚那是什么船体
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是海龟号
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海龟?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是Cobra的宇宙船
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能 他不可能还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌人在后方急速接近 进入迎击态势
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌人距离我方只有五千米了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要让他们死无全尸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开舰后方炮门!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们开炮了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,启动防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,超级大炮发射准备
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,距离: 5,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,距离: 3,500!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,距离: 3,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还不能开炮 我要一炮打沉它
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,距离: 2,500!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看招!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才的攻击来自哪个方向?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好了 右方引擎被摧毁了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.93,0:14:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,单靠左侧的引擎是躲不过敌人的攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,珍...珍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,珍 多米里克 卡纱莲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,珍!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,主引擎输出功率下降 舰后方防护罩已损毁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是照目前飞行速度\N海龟号不久便会无法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道我们再没有武器攻击了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要武器我有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的左手枪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开舱门
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra瞄准次元潜航舰的工会标记\N那后面是燃料库
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,工会标记吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是缠人的船 我要一口气摧毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开雷霆大炮炮门
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,位置前方 雷霆大炮发射准备完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是...海龟号上有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发射雷霆大炮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是愚蠢的男人 打算用精神感应枪\N能对付这艘战舰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要击溃你!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能 你是打倒不了他的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雷霆大炮发射 这次一定要命中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 紧急停船
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,燃料库起火
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第二 第三甲板被炸毁\N主引擎停止运作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经改用辅助引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.89,0:16:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快离开异次元空间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra 他们不见了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎是逃到了通常空间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 计算出他们的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们也要在他们的肚子里实体化
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海龟号?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在的我是在用尽\N精神感应枪的力量来打败你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁想变成烧肉就上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那...那家伙是怪物!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra次元移动回路有点不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无法持续实体化了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 因为塞车 让你久候了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:18:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住 否则这个女人会死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦~您要去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 我现在要带着创造宇宙的力量\N回工会总部接受奖赏仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奖赏仪式吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你被判死刑时别忘记叫我去观礼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你无法去参加奖赏仪式了\N因为你要在这里中途下车
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住..住手!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没受伤吧 由托皮亚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来 这里也有紧急救生艇\N我们就从这里逃出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你遗失了护身符啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 因为你就是我的护身符了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带着这个退回
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra与你一决雌雄的时刻似乎来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就做个了断吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对我来说你是我的恶梦\N只要你活着我便无法睡得安稳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:20:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,精神感应枪对我不起效\N你已经毫无所剩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还剩的有...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,破裂吧 你这玻璃人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会破裂的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的身体以特殊活晶体制造
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坚硬时能将铅弹反射回去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,柔软时可像女性充满弹性的肌肤一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,水晶男孩呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那小子在微波炉里被烤熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕 这艘船不久后就会四分五裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办 Cobra?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫回莱迪吧 她应该还在异次元空间里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在主机械室有异次元通信装置
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:21:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.85,0:22:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胜负尚未分晓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真令人吃惊 这家伙还真是命硬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被美女的脚迷住了吗 男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看招!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结束了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的恶梦终于结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是创造宇宙的力量?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.35,0:23:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.43,0:23:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但怎么样看也只是像个没用的海螺壳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过请看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是星云
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是尚未诞生的银河
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里面有几千亿颗星星存活着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个是宇宙卵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙卵吗\N可是工会为什么想要得到新银河呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们打算做房地产生意吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这本应该被释放到没有星星的黑暗空间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过要是他们在银河系里释放\N另外一个银河的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,银河系统就会发生大爆炸\N从宇宙中消失
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.85,0:24:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 是我 你听见吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra你没事呒?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.06,0:24:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还活着 你现在在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还在异次元空间中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.73,0:24:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会马上修理好 然后去你那边
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.14,0:24:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就拜托你快一点了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.48,0:24:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这艘次元潜航舰马上要四分五裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,OK 等着我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.10,0:24:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是工会的舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.52,0:25:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是海贼工会太阳系方面司令官\N雷德.波恩
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.23,0:25:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我代表工会转告波鲁多伯爵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.93,0:25:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很可惜 伯爵他去宇宙野营了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来是的 你就是Cobra吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.85,0:25:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快把宇宙卵交给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我拒绝的话呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.27,0:25:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就连人带船将你们炸得粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.23,0:25:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后再回收那只宇宙卵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.56,0:25:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来是穷途末路了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这宇宙卵要如何释放呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.56,0:25:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一带正好是没有星星的黑暗宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.18,0:25:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正适合创造新银河
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.27,0:25:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是Cobra 这样做我们也会...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.89,0:26:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是最上面那条柱子 将它向左边旋转
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.81,0:26:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.35,0:26:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不能将它交给他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.48,0:27:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来你用了时间枪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.43,0:27:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和我身边的时间都停顿了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.10,0:27:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.73,0:27:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看到那个了吗 Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是新的银河...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.27,0:27:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在正观赏宇宙的诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.77,0:27:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此 今天是生日吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.43,0:27:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会在日记上记下的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.85,0:27:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是它的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.35,0:27:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给这银河起个名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想想...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.89,0:27:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个名字如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.93,0:27:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就叫乌托邦
